"The ear was closed — it's open now. Give it a breath, then ask again and I'll name the loudest thing on the air." = "O ouvido estava fechado — está aberto agora. Dá-lhe um fôlego, depois pergunta outra vez e eu digo a coisa mais ruidosa no ar.";
"The house vanished: everything halted, full stealth." = "A casa desapareceu: tudo detido, stealth total.";
